<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font face="HelveticaNeue" size="4" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font></div><font face="HelveticaNeue" size="4" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><br><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">Thank you, for recently downloading or finding us from the following:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ul class="Apple-dash-list"><li><font size="4">Downloading one of our e-books from Bigger Pockets</font></li><li><font size="4">Google Search</font></li><li><font size="4">Visited Memphis Invest Website</font></li><li><font size="4">Heard about us from a friend or colleague&nbsp;</font></li></ul><div><font size="4"><br></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">No matter how you heard about Memphis Invest, we are glad you found us!</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div><font size="4"><br></font></div><div><font size="4">Now, I don't want to take up too much of your time but, I wanted to quickly&nbsp;introduce myself and&nbsp;our company.</font>&nbsp;</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">My name is Joshua Jackson and I am a portfolio advisor at Memphis Invest.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style=""><font size="4" style="">Our company,&nbsp;<strong style=""><a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" style=""><font style="" color="#3366ff">Memphis Invest</font></a></strong>, is the largest and most importantly,&nbsp;<strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">respected&nbsp;</strong>turnkey real estate investment company in the country.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">We have pioneered the passive real estate investment market by helping over<span class="Apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span>1600<span class="Apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span>(and counting)<b><span class="Apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span></b>investors<span class="Apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span>achieve long term wealth.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">Currently, Memphis Invest, has renovated and rented over&nbsp;<strong>4500+</strong>&nbsp;single family properties in 5 of the best performing markets in the country.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">Now, we don't claim to be perfect by any means, but we have learned a thing or two since we started a little over 14 years ago.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font size="4" style="">You can learn more about our story&nbsp;<strong style=""><a href="https://youtu.be/d5P7wDuBswQ?list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" style=""><font face="Helvetica Neue" style="" color="#3366ff">here</font></a>.</strong></font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><strong><font size="4"><br></font></strong></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4">I would highly recommend that you visit our website to learn a little more about us and the impact we have made with investors all over the country.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4">After you have visited the website, I would love to schedule an introduction call to discuss building your passive real estate portfolio.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4" style="">To do this, simply click the link below in my signature</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4">I look forward to talking with you soon!</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4">Take care,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4">Joshua</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/joshua-jackson-one-to-one"><br></a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/joshua-jackson-one-to-one"><br></a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; f